# Migration assessment: `Example Cloud`, `Example Cloud North`

- Inventory file: `inventory.json`
- Source: `aws`
- Catalog: `Example Cloud` snapshot from `https://www.example.com/pricing/`, retrieved 2026-11-13
- Catalog: `Example Cloud North` snapshot from `https://www.example.com/pricing/north/`, retrieved 2026-11-14
- Region: `Example Cloud`: `xx-par` (the target's default for estimates)
- Region: `Example Cloud North`: `xx-ams` (the target's default for estimates)

## Comparison

### Summary

| Fit | `Example Cloud` | `Example Cloud North` |
|---|---|---|
| direct | 7 | 7 |
| partial | 0 | 0 |
| none | 1 | 1 |
| total | 8 | 8 |
| `Example Cloud` estimate | €2,535.00 per month for 4 of 8 resources |  |
| `Example Cloud North` estimate |  | €2,539.00 per month for 4 of 8 resources |

Estimates are list prices on each catalog's retrieval date, excluding VAT and discounts; each target's own section gives its basis.

### Resources

| ID | Category | `Example Cloud` fit | `Example Cloud` best offering | `Example Cloud` monthly estimate | `Example Cloud North` fit | `Example Cloud North` best offering | `Example Cloud North` monthly estimate |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `bucket-storage` | `storage.object` | direct | `Example Object Storage` | €2,500.00 | direct | `Example Object Storage` | €2,500.00 |
| `cluster-small` | `kubernetes.managed` | direct | `Example Kubernetes` | €15.00 (includes a fixed fee of €5.00) (count assumed 1) (730 hours assumed) | direct | `Example Kubernetes` | €15.00 (includes a fixed fee of €5.00) (count assumed 1) (730 hours assumed) |
| `function-orders` | `serverless.function` | direct | `Example Functions` | not estimated: usage-priced | direct | `Example Functions` | not estimated: usage-priced |
| `legacy-nosize` | `compute.vm` | direct | `Example Virtual Machines` | not estimated: size unknown | direct | `Example Virtual Machines` | not estimated: size unknown |
| `queue-jobs` | `messaging.queue` | none |  | not estimated: no fit | none |  | not estimated: no fit |
| `server-huge` | `compute.vm` | direct | `Example Virtual Machines` | not estimated: no plan large enough | direct | `Example Virtual Machines` | not estimated: no plan large enough |
| `server-small` | `compute.vm` | direct | `Example Virtual Machines` | €10.00 (count assumed 1) (730 hours assumed) | direct | `Example Virtual Machines` | €12.00 (count assumed 1) (730 hours assumed) |
| `worker-jobs` | `compute.vm` | direct | `Example Virtual Machines` | €10.00 (count assumed 1) (730 hours assumed) | direct | `Example Virtual Machines` | €12.00 (count assumed 1) (730 hours assumed) |

### Blockers on every target

- `queue-jobs`
  - `Example Cloud`: no offering in the `Example Cloud` catalog for `messaging.queue`
  - `Example Cloud North`: no offering in the `Example Cloud North` catalog for `messaging.queue`

