|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `bucket-storage` | `AWS::S3::Bucket` | `storage.object` | direct | `Example Object Storage` |  | €2,500.00 |  | `Example Object Storage` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `cluster-small` | `Scaleway::Kubernetes::Cluster` | `kubernetes.managed` | direct | `Example Kubernetes` | `KN-S` (1 vCPU, 2 GiB) | €15.00 (includes a fixed fee of €5.00) (count assumed 1) (730 hours assumed) |  | `Example Kubernetes` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `function-orders` | `AWS::Lambda::Function` | `serverless.function` | direct | `Example Functions` |  | not estimated: usage-priced |  | `Example Functions` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `legacy-nosize` | `AWS::EC2::Instance` | `compute.vm` | direct | `Example Virtual Machines` |  | not estimated: size unknown |  | `Example Virtual Machines` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `queue-jobs` | `AWS::SQS::Queue` | `messaging.queue` | none |  |  | not estimated: no fit |  | no offering in the `Example Cloud` catalog for `messaging.queue` |
| `server-huge` | `AWS::EC2::Instance` | `compute.vm` | direct | `Example Virtual Machines` | no plan large enough (largest: `EX-L`, 4 vCPU, 8 GiB) | not estimated: no plan large enough |  | `Example Virtual Machines` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `server-small` | `AWS::EC2::Instance` | `compute.vm` | direct | `Example Virtual Machines` | `EX-S` (1 vCPU, 2 GiB) | €10.00 (count assumed 1) (730 hours assumed) |  | `Example Virtual Machines` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `worker-jobs` | `AWS::EC2::Instance` | `compute.vm` | direct | `Example Virtual Machines` | `EX-S` (1 vCPU, 2 GiB) | €10.00 (count assumed 1) (730 hours assumed) | depends-on `queue-jobs`, replica-of `server-small` | `Example Virtual Machines` offers every capability the resource uses |

### Required changes

None.

### Blockers

- `queue-jobs`: no offering in the `Example Cloud` catalog for `messaging.queue`
- `worker-jobs`: affected by a blocker on `queue-jobs`

